---
Update skills added from repositories

Usage: sbt skills update [OPTIONS] [SKILLS]...

Arguments:
  [SKILLS]...


Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

      --no-input
          Never prompt; commands that need an answer fail with the command to run instead

  -h, --help
          Print help
